This product is a modified derivative work based on CGBuilder
(https://github.com/jbarnoud/cgbuilder), Copyright Jonathan Barnoud and the
CGBuilder contributors, used under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes relative to the original CGBuilder include: a modular ES-module rewrite
bundled with Vite; live GROMACS/Martini .itp topology generation; builders for
bonds, constraints, angles, dihedrals, virtual sites and an elastic network;
automatic, mass-conserving bead masses; in-browser SMILES-to-3D input; 3D
connectivity visualization; editable/round-tripping topology and mapping files;
and full project save/load.

